Leftovers from the abandoned attempt (2026-09-22) to serve video straight from S3 through this
CloudFront distribution. Never deployed; video now plays from Cloudflare Stream instead. Set
aside on 2026-09-24 before deploying R2 read access for photo originals, because it would have:
renamed the stack (ImgTransformationStack -> ImgTransformationStack-Dev/-Prod, i.e. a brand-new
distribution and domain), dropped the lenslyst-development fallback bucket, and added video
passthrough behaviors. Applies to the committed code (git apply this file on a clean checkout).

